---
title: Analyze Media & Extract Identities
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as WordPress Plugin
    participant API as /recognition/analyze
    participant Session as AsyncSession + tenant context
    participant Jobs as IdentityScanJob rows
    participant BG as BackgroundTasks (_process_scan_chunk)
    participant ScanSvc as IdentityScanService
    participant Provider as FaceEmbeddingProvider
    participant DB as PostgreSQL + pgvector
    participant Thumbs as ThumbnailService storage

    Client->>API: POST analyze {tenant_id, site_url?, media_items[], user_id?}
    API->>Session: set_tenant_context(); create tenant if missing
    API->>API: chunk media_items into batches of 10
    loop per chunk
        API->>Session: insert IdentityScanJob(status=pending)
        API->>BG: add_task(_process_scan_chunk, job_id, tenant_id, chunk, user_id)
    end
    API-->>Client: 202 accepted {job_ids, status="queued"}

    BG->>Session: async_session_factory()
    BG->>Session: set_tenant_context(tenant_id)
    BG->>Provider: load InsightFace model (if needed)
    BG->>ScanSvc: scan_identities(job, media_items, user_id)
    ScanSvc->>Provider: analyze(image) -> IdentityEmbedding[]
    ScanSvc->>Thumbs: save cropped thumbnails (optional)
    ScanSvc->>DB: insert MediaIdentity rows; update job counters
    alt success
        ScanSvc->>DB: commit; job.status="completed"
    else error
        ScanSvc->>DB: rollback; job.status="failed"; job.error_message
    end
